		<SimpleData name="notes">FPCI total score 43 = high rank. Telachick Rd 5.2 km; Watershed Code 180-088500. 3x 600mm round CMPs, outlet velocities (~1.33-1.38 m/s) exceed juvenile RB swim speed (adults only can ascend). Stream length gained 13560 m (13.56 km). % stream barred: office calc 40%, Form B 73%, matrix &gt;70%. Limiting to Site 1. X-ref sites 1,5.</SimpleData>
